# ── Material privado do TLS do MQTT (nunca versionar: repositório público) ─────
# Ficam só na máquina e nos Secrets do cluster (chirpstack-v4-mosquitto-tls,
# chirpstack-v4-mosquitto-ca, chirpstack-v4-mosquitto-auth). Os .crt são públicos.
06.chirpstack_v4/mqtt-certs/*.key
06.chirpstack_v4/mqtt-certs/*.srl
06.chirpstack_v4/mqtt-certs/*.csr
06.chirpstack_v4/mqtt-certs/passwd
*.key

